STATUS
Bounded exact audit of the outside-in perfect-elimination order.  The
unbounded statement is proved algebraically in Lemma 5A8H27.

COMMAND
character_ring_iter/analyze_su2_fusion_chordality 300

OUTPUT
SU2_FUSION_CHORDALITY maximum_level=300 parameters=5550 eliminated_vertices=565175 clique_tests=155495867 result=PASS_OUTSIDE_IN_PEO_DISCOVERY

INTERPRETATION
For every even level k and even q with 2q<k, the verifier checks that

  0,k,2,k-2,4,k-4,...

is a perfect-elimination order for the even-label q-fusion graph.  It
checks every pair of remaining neighbors at every elimination step.
The pass covers 5,550 graphs, 565,175 eliminated vertices, and
155,495,867 exact clique tests.

